# libbw_audio.so is BUILD OUTPUT (staged here by an Android cross-build, and by CI when it packs
# the UPM tarball) - never committed. Its .meta file IS committed: a package installed from a
# registry is immutable, so the plugin's import settings (Android, CPU ARM64, Editor off) cannot
# be fixed in the Inspector afterwards - they have to ship. See tools/upm/gen-meta.ps1.
*.so
!.gitkeep
!*.so.meta
